<div class=3D"ms12">
<b>Notes:</b>
<ul>
<li style=3D"list-style-position: outside">  " flag - set if we're currentl=
y inside a double quoted part
</li><li style=3D"list-style-position: outside">The algorithm only looks fo=
r {space}, {tab}, and ("). All other characters are just characters.
</li><li style=3D"list-style-position: outside">You can't pass a double quo=
te (") as part of a parameter because double quotes are always stripped off=
.
</li></ul>
</div>

