820.aspx</span></a>
<br>Note: JPSoft's Take Command command line utility processes % differentl=
y. You'll need to quadruple the % char (<a href=3D"http://jpsoft.com/" targ=
et=3D"_blank"><span class=3D"nobr">http://jpsoft.com</span></a>)
